---
Protect project load/save during playback.

Stop playback before loading or saving a project to prevent data races.
With the command queue (TASK-152), send a STOP command and wait for
acknowledgement before performing any project I/O.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Project save stops playback first, then serializes state
- [ ] Project load stops playback first, then deserializes state
- [ ] Playback resumes (or stays stopped) after load/save completes
- [ ] No crash or corruption when Ctrl+S pressed during playback
- [ ] No crash or corruption when Ctrl+O pressed during playback

## Test Plan
- [ ] Start playback, press Ctrl+S, verify no crash and project saved correctly
- [ ] Start playback, press Ctrl+O, verify no crash and project loaded correctly
- [ ] TSan run: save/load during playback shows no data races
